            },
            "reviewBody": "Very good recipe. I used raw sugar and apple cider vinegar and simmered the ginger for about a half an hour since we were going to use it with our sushi that day. It turned out wonderful and will be a staple in our fridge from now on. InshaAllah",
            "datePublished": "2018-04-03T10:53:01.420Z"
