              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "CHRISTYDAWNE"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I bought a big pack of ginger at Costco to try this. I started out by peeling the ginger but that got exhausting and I felt like I was wasting a ton, so I ended up just running the second half through the mandoline. Next time I’ll use the food processor. We love this on a salad or in smoothies. I keep it in the fridge all the time!",
